<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="403">
<tr>
<td>R1(config-ipv6-acl)# tolak | izinkan protokol {source-ipv6-prefix/prefix-length | apapun | host sumber-alamat-ipv6} [operator [nomor-port]] {awalan-ipv6 tujuan/panjang awalan | apapun | host tujuan-alamat-ipv6} [operator [nomor port]]</td>
</tr>
</table>
]]></text>

<text id="ID_s2_01"><![CDATA[
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="400"> <tr> <td>R1(konfigurasi)#<strong>daftar akses ipv6 NO-FTP-TO-11</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R1(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>tolak tcp any 2001:db8:cafe:11::/64 eq ftp</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R1(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>tolak tcp any 2001:db8:cafe:11::/64 eq ftp-data</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R1(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>izinkan ipv6 apa saja</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R1(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>KELUAR</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R1(konfigurasi)#<strong>antarmuka g0/0</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R1(config-if)#<strong>filter lalu lintas ipv6 NO-FTP-TO-11 in</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R1(config-if)#</td> </tr></table>
]]></text>

<text id="ID_s3_01"><![CDATA[
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="535"> <tr> <td width="385">R3(konfigurasi)#<strong>daftar akses ipv6 AKSES YANG DIBATALKAN</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R3(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>komentar Izinkan akses hanya HTTP dan HTTPS ke Jaringan 10</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="flooter">R3(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>izinkan tcp host mana pun 2001:db8:cafe:10::10 eq 80</strong><br/>R3(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>izinkan tcp host mana pun 2001:db8:cafe:10::10 eq 443</strong></span><strong><span class="connect"></span><span class="num1">1</span></strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R3(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>komentar Tolak semua lalu lintas lainnya ke Jaringan 10</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="flooter">R3(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>tolak ipv6 apa pun 2001:db8:cafe:10::/64</strong></span><span class="num2">2</span></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R3(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>komentar Izinkan akses telnet PC3 ke PC2</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="flooter">R3(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>izin tcp host 2001:DB8:CAFE:30::12 host 2001:DB8:CAFE:11::11 eq 23</strong></span><span class="num2">3</span></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R3(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>komentar Tolak akses telnet ke PC2 untuk semua perangkat lainnya</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="flooter">R3(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>tolak tcp host mana pun 2001:db8:cafe:11::11 eq 23</strong></span><span class="num2">4</span></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R3(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>komentar Izinkan akses ke yang lainnya</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td><span class="flooter">R3(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>izinkan ipv6 apa saja</strong></span><span class="num2">5</span></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R3(config-ipv6-acl)#<strong>KELUAR</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R3(konfigurasi)#<strong>antarmuka g0/0</strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R3(config-if)#<strong>filter lalu lintas ipv6 AKSES TERBATAS di</strong><strong><span>6</span></strong></td> </tr> <tr> <td>R3(config-if)#</td> </tr></table>
]]></text>


